Hussain Zinda Hai Shaheed Zinda Hai<br>
khuda Ka Kehna Hai Shaheed Zinda Hai<br>
<br>
1. Kaha Tha Zehra Se Nabi Ne Ro Ro Kar<br>
<br>
karenge Gham Sheh Ka Muhib Tere Ro Kar<br>
<br>
azal Ka Waada Nibhaya Jaata Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Kahega Mehshar Me Yeh Khaleq-e-akbar<br>
<br>
hai Matam-e-sarwar Najaat Ka Mehwar<br>
<br>
hussain Ka Jo Hai Wohi Hamara Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Luta Ke Ghar Apna Hussain Kehte Hai<br>
<br>
kata Ke Sar Apna Hussain Kehte Ha<br>
<br>
yu'n Wada-e-tifli Nibhaya Jata Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Hussain Ke Saathi Toh Mar Nahi Sakte<br>
<br>
kata Ke Sar Apna Woh Mar Nahi Sakte<br>
<br>
yeh Haq Ka Kehna Hai Shaheed Zinda Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Karenge Duniya Me Hussain Ka Matam<br>
<br>
gar Aaye Toofa'n Bhi Na Hoga Phir Bhi Kam<br>
<br>
yeh Matam-e-sarwar Dua-e-zehra Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Hussain Ke Jaisa Na Ban Saka Koi<br>
<br>
baya'n Hai Khaleq Ka Na Ban Saka Koi<br>
<br>
tamaam Duniya Me Wohi Akela Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Yeh Hashmi Saber Hain Noukar-e-sarwar<br>
<br>
ataa Hai Sarwar Ki Karam Hai Yeh Unpar<br>
<br>
aza Ki Duniya Me Dua-e-zehra Hai